# Normalise to LF in the repo and in every working copy. Without this, core.autocrlf=true
# checks the tree out with CRLF on Windows and `npm run format:check` (Prettier defaults to
# endOfLine: "lf") flags every tracked file right after a fresh clone, while CI on Linux
# stays green.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
